===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Anything which [[radiate]]s or emits rays.
# {{cx|utomotive|lang=en}} A device that lowers engine coolant temperature by conducting heat to the air, through metal fins.
# {{cx|of buildings|lang=en}} A finned metal fixture that carries hot water or steam in order to heat a room.
# {{context|electronics|lang=en}} A type of antenna.

